{"id":"a1.u05","level":"A1","order":5,"title":{"en":"My day","ru":"Мой день"},"description":"Рассказываем о том, что мы делаем каждый день: встаём, завтракаем, идём на работу. Present Simple, время на часах, дни недели и предлоги времени.","goals":["Могу рассказать о своём обычном дне: I get up at seven.","Могу сказать, что делает другой человек: He works in an office.","Могу сказать «не»: I don't work on Sunday. She doesn't work on Saturday.","Могу спросить и назвать время: What time is it? It is half past seven.","Могу назвать дни недели и использовать at, on, in.","Могу написать короткий текст о своём дне."],"grammar":["a1.present-simple","a1.telling-time","a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["tenses","prepositions"],"texts":[{"id":"a1.u05.work-day","kind":"dialogue","genre":"conversation","title":{"en":"Six o'clock","ru":"Шесть часов"},"speakers":[{"id":"anna","name":"Anna","voice":"female"},{"id":"tom","name":"Tom","voice":"male"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"anna","en":"Tom, it is six o'clock.","ru":"Том, уже шесть часов."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Yes. I finish work at six.","ru":"Да. Я заканчиваю работу в шесть."},{"speaker":"anna","en":"I start work at nine and finish at five.","ru":"Я начинаю работу в девять, а заканчиваю в пять."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"And on Saturday?","ru":"А в субботу?"},{"speaker":"anna","en":"On Saturday I do not work. I sleep late.","ru":"В субботу я не работаю. Я долго сплю."},{"speaker":"tom","en":"I also sleep late on Saturday. And I read a book.","ru":"Я тоже долго сплю в субботу. И читаю книгу."}],"glossary":[]},{"id":"a1.u05.max-day","kind":"reading","genre":"article","title":{"en":"Max's day","ru":"День Макса"},"speakers":[],"lines":[{"en":"Max is a designer. He gets up at seven and takes a shower. Then he has breakfast at half past seven.","ru":"Макс — дизайнер. Он встаёт в семь и принимает душ. Потом в половине восьмого завтракает."},{"en":"He leaves home at eight and walks to the office. He works from nine to six.","ru":"В восемь он выходит из дома и идёт в офис пешком. Он работает с девяти до шести."},{"en":"In the evening he cooks dinner and reads a book. He sleeps at eleven.","ru":"Вечером он готовит ужин и читает книгу. Он спит с одиннадцати."},{"en":"On Saturday and Sunday he does not work. He sleeps late and meets his friends.","ru":"В субботу и воскресенье он не работает. Он долго спит и встречается с друзьями."}],"glossary":[]}],"lessons":[{"id":"a1.u05.l01","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Что я делаю каждый день","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e01","hint":"Get up и wake up — разные вещи: сначала проснуться, потом встать.","explanation":"Get up — «вставать», wake up — «просыпаться», sleep — «спать», go — «идти», come — «приходить».","difficulty":1,"words":["wake-up","get-up","go","come","sleep"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"get up","ru":"вставать"},{"en":"wake up","ru":"просыпаться"},{"en":"sleep","ru":"спать"},{"en":"go","ru":"идти"},{"en":"come","ru":"приходить"}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e02","hint":"Start и finish — противоположные слова.","explanation":"Work — «работать», study — «учиться», start — «начинать», finish — «заканчивать», leave — «уходить».","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","study","start","finish","leave"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"work","ru":"работать"},{"en":"study","ru":"учиться"},{"en":"start","ru":"начинать"},{"en":"finish","ru":"заканчивать"},{"en":"leave","ru":"уходить"}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e03","hint":"Cook вы уже знаете как «повар».","explanation":"Read — «читать», cook — «готовить», clean — «убирать», play — «играть», walk — «гулять, ходить пешком».","difficulty":1,"words":["read","cook#verb","clean","play","walk"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["false-friends"],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"read","ru":"читать"},{"en":"cook","ru":"готовить"},{"en":"clean","ru":"убирать"},{"en":"play","ru":"играть"},{"en":"walk","ru":"гулять"}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e04","hint":"Breakfast — первый приём пищи.","explanation":"Have breakfast — «завтракать». Have lunch — «обедать», have dinner — «ужинать». С едой говорят have.","difficulty":1,"words":["have","breakfast"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"have breakfast","options":["завтракать","обедать","ужинать"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e05","hint":"Начинается с l, гласная короткая.","explanation":"Live [lɪv] — «жить». Leave [liːv] — «уходить»: гласная долгая.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","sleep","live"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"жить","options":["live","work","sleep"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e06","hint":"Shower — душ.","explanation":"Take a shower — «принимать душ». Take — «брать, принимать».","difficulty":1,"words":["take"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"take a shower","options":["принимать душ","брать зонт","делать уборку"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e07","hint":"Яичница — типичное утреннее блюдо.","explanation":"Breakfast — «завтрак»: [ˈbrekfəst].","difficulty":1,"words":["breakfast"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"breakfast","distractors":["lunch","dinner"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e08","hint":"Туда ходят дети.","explanation":"School — «школа»: [skuːl]. Office — «офис».","difficulty":1,"words":["school"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"word-to-picture","word":"school","distractors":["office","house"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e09","hint":"Первое слово — wake, как «вэйк».","explanation":"Wake up [weɪk ʌp] — «просыпаться». Get up [ɡet ʌp] — «вставать».","difficulty":1,"words":["wake-up","get-up","go","work","work#noun"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"wake up","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["wake up","get up","go to work"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e10","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"I get up at seven — «я встаю в семь».","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I get up at seven.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e11","hint":"Четыре буквы.","explanation":"Read [riːd] — «читать».","difficulty":1,"words":["read"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"читать","answers":["read"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e12","hint":"С едой — особый глагол.","explanation":"I have breakfast at eight. Завтракать — have breakfast.","difficulty":1,"words":["have","go","sleep","breakfast"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ breakfast at eight.","translation":"Я завтракаю в восемь.","answers":[["have"]],"options":["have","sleep","go"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e13","hint":"К глаголу go нужно to.","explanation":"I go to school — «я иду в школу». После go — to + место.","difficulty":1,"words":["go","school"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Я иду в школу.","answer":"I go to school.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["am","at"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e15","hint":"Слово «потом».","explanation":"I take a shower, then I have breakfast. Then — «потом»: [ðen].","difficulty":1,"words":["have","take","past","day","then","breakfast"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I take a shower, ___ I have breakfast.","translation":"Я принимаю душ, потом завтракаю.","answers":[["then"]],"options":["then","past","day"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e16","hint":"Не путайте с walk и work.","explanation":"Watch [wɑːtʃ] — «смотреть»; walk [wɔːk] — «гулять»; work [wɝːk] — «работать».","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","watch#verb","walk"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"смотреть фильм или матч","options":["watch","walk","work"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l01.e14","hint":"Три действия подряд.","explanation":"Get up, take a shower, have breakfast — обычное утро. Следите за ударением в breakfast: BREAK-fast.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up","have","take","breakfast"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"I get up, take a shower and have breakfast."}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02","kind":"grammar","title":"Present Simple: I work, she works","grammar":"a1.present-simple","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e01","hint":"С I глагол не меняется.","explanation":"I work in an office. С I — начальная форма глагола.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","office"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ in an office.","translation":"Я работаю в офисе.","answers":[["work"]],"options":["work","works","am work"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e02","hint":"С she — окончание -s.","explanation":"She works in a school. С she, he, it — глагол с -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","school"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ in a school.","translation":"Она работает в школе.","answers":[["works"]],"options":["works","work","is work"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e03","hint":"С he — окончание -s.","explanation":"He gets up at seven. Глагол get получает -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He ___ up at seven.","translation":"Он встаёт в семь.","answers":[["gets"]],"options":["gets","get","getting"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e04","hint":"Согласная + y меняется на -ies.","explanation":"She studies English. Study → studies: y меняется на ies.","difficulty":1,"words":["study"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ English.","translation":"Она изучает английский.","answers":[["studies"]],"options":["studies","studys","study"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e05","hint":"С he — глагол с -s.","explanation":"Правильно: He takes a shower every morning.","difficulty":1,"words":["take","morning"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He ___ a shower every morning.","translation":"Он принимает душ каждое утро.","answers":[["takes"]],"options":["takes","take","is take"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e06","hint":"Have — особый глагол.","explanation":"She has breakfast at eight. Have → has, а не haves.","difficulty":1,"words":["have","breakfast"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ breakfast at eight.","translation":"Она завтракает в восемь.","answers":[["has"]],"options":["has","haves","have"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e07","hint":"После o — окончание -es.","explanation":"Правильно: My sister goes to school. Go → goes.","difficulty":1,"words":["go","school"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"My sister ___ to school.","translation":"Моя сестра ходит в школу.","answers":[["goes"]],"options":["goes","go","gos"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e08","hint":"С she — окончание -s.","explanation":"She works in an office. Забыть -s — самая частая ошибка.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","office"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"She work in an office.","wrong":"work","correction":"works","options":["works","working","is work"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e09","hint":"В Present Simple be не нужен.","explanation":"I work in a school. Глагол be и обычный глагол вместе не ставят.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","school"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I am work in a school.","wrong":"am work","correction":"work","options":["work","am working","works"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e10","hint":"После o — -es.","explanation":"Правильно: He goes to school. Go → goes.","difficulty":1,"words":["go","school"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"error_correction","text":"He gos to school.","wrong":"gos","correction":"goes","options":["goes","go","going"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e11","hint":"Работает — works.","explanation":"He works in an office. С he — works; перед office — an.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","office"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Он работает в офисе.","answer":"He works in an office.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["work","a"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e12","hint":"Get up — вставать.","explanation":"I get up at seven. Перед временем — at.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Я встаю в семь.","answers":["I get up at seven."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e13","hint":"С she нужен -s.","explanation":"She reads a book. Глагол read получает -s.","difficulty":2,"words":["read"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Она читает книгу.","answers":["She reads a book."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e15","hint":"С I глагол не меняется.","explanation":"Правильно: I meet my friends on Saturday. С I глагол без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["meet","saturday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ my friends on Saturday.","translation":"Я встречаюсь с друзьями в субботу.","answers":[["meet"]],"options":["meet","meets","meeting"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l02.e14","hint":"В одном слове долгий гласный.","explanation":"Live [lɪv] — короткий гласный, leave [liːv] — долгий. Слова легко спутать.","difficulty":1,"words":["live","leave"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"minimal_pair","pair":[{"en":"live","ipa":"lɪv"},{"en":"leave","ipa":"liːv"}],"say":1}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03","kind":"grammar","title":"Не делаю: don't и doesn't","grammar":"a1.present-simple","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e01","hint":"Отрицание с I.","explanation":"I don't (do not) work on Sunday. С I, you, we, they — don't.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I ___ work on Sunday.","translation":"Я не работаю в воскресенье.","answers":[["don't","do not"]],"options":["don't","doesn't","am not"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e02","hint":"Отрицание с she.","explanation":"She doesn't (does not) work on Saturday. С he, she, it — doesn't.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","saturday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ work on Saturday.","translation":"Она не работает в субботу.","answers":[["doesn't","does not"]],"options":["doesn't","don't","isn't"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e03","hint":"Отрицание с we.","explanation":"Правильно: We don't (do not) have a car.","difficulty":1,"words":["have","do"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"We ___ have a car.","translation":"У нас нет машины.","answers":[["don't","do not"]],"options":["don't","doesn't","aren't"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e04","hint":"После doesn't глагол без -s.","explanation":"He doesn't get up early. После doesn't — начальная форма.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up","do","early"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He doesn't ___ up early.","translation":"Он не встаёт рано.","answers":[["get"]],"options":["get","gets","getting"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e05","hint":"Окончание -s уже в doesn't.","explanation":"She doesn't work on Sunday. После doesn't — глагол без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"She doesn't works on Sunday.","wrong":"works","correction":"work","options":["work","working","worked"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e06","hint":"С he — другая форма.","explanation":"He doesn't read in the evening. С he — doesn't.","difficulty":1,"words":["read","do","evening"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"He don't read in the evening.","wrong":"don't","correction":"doesn't","options":["doesn't","isn't","not"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e07","hint":"Для «не» перед глаголом нужен don't.","explanation":"I don't work on Sunday. Слово no перед глаголом не ставят.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I no work on Sunday.","wrong":"no work","correction":"don't work","options":["don't work","not work","am not work"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e08","hint":"Doesn't + глагол без -s.","explanation":"He doesn't work on Sunday. С he — doesn't, потом work.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Он не работает в воскресенье.","answer":"He doesn't work on Sunday.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["don't","works"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e09","hint":"Образец: Don't + have.","explanation":"I don't have breakfast. Have стоит без изменений.","difficulty":1,"words":["have","do","breakfast"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Я не завтракаю.","answer":"I don't have breakfast.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["doesn't","am"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e10","hint":"Образец: Doesn't + live.","explanation":"She doesn't live in Moscow. После doesn't — live без -s.","difficulty":2,"words":["live","do"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Она не живёт в Москве.","answers":["She doesn't live in Moscow.","She does not live in Moscow."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e11","hint":"С we — don't.","explanation":"We don't work on Saturday. Перед днём недели — on.","difficulty":2,"words":["work","work#noun","do","saturday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple","a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Мы не работаем в субботу.","answers":["We don't work on Saturday.","We do not work on Saturday."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e12","hint":"Слышно doesn't.","explanation":"She doesn't work on Sunday — «она не работает в воскресенье».","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"She doesn't work on Sunday.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["She doesn't work on Sunday.","She works on Sunday.","I don't work on Sunday."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e13","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"I don't work on Sunday — «я не работаю в воскресенье».","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I don't work on Sunday.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u05.l03.e14","hint":"I work… или I don't work…","explanation":"Отвечаем полным предложением: I work on Sunday. I don't work on Sunday.","difficulty":3,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"Do you work on Sunday?","questionRu":"Вы работаете в воскресенье? Ответьте: I work on Sunday или I don't work on Sunday.","keywords":[["\\bI (do not|don't|work)\\b"],["\\bSunday\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I don't work on Sunday.","I work on Sunday."]}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Который час?","grammar":"a1.telling-time","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e01","hint":"Half — половина, quarter — четверть.","explanation":"Seven o'clock — 7:00, half past seven — 7:30, quarter past seven — 7:15, quarter to eight — 7:45, ten past seven — 7:10. Время записано цифрами.","difficulty":1,"words":["o-clock","half","quarter","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"seven o'clock","ru":"ровно семь (7:00)"},{"en":"half past seven","ru":"половина (7:30)"},{"en":"quarter past seven","ru":"четверть после (7:15)"},{"en":"quarter to eight","ru":"без четверти (7:45)"},{"en":"ten past seven","ru":"десять минут после (7:10)"}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e02","hint":"Целый час — просто число.","explanation":"It is nine o'clock. К целому часу добавляют o'clock.","difficulty":1,"words":["o-clock","half","quarter"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It is ___ o'clock.","translation":"Сейчас девять часов.","answers":[["nine"]],"options":["nine","half","quarter"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e03","hint":"Первая половина часа.","explanation":"It is half past six — 6:30. Half past + предыдущий час.","difficulty":1,"words":["half","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It is half ___ six.","translation":"Сейчас половина седьмого (6:30).","answers":[["past"]],"options":["past","to","at"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e04","hint":"До восьми — to.","explanation":"It is quarter to eight — 7:45. Quarter to — «без четверти».","difficulty":1,"words":["quarter","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It is quarter ___ eight.","translation":"Без четверти восемь (7:45).","answers":[["to"]],"options":["to","past","at"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e05","hint":"Перед точным временем.","explanation":"I get up at seven. Перед временем всегда at.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time","a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I get up ___ seven.","translation":"Я встаю в семь.","answers":[["at"]],"options":["at","in","on"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e06","hint":"Half past eight — не «половина девятого».","explanation":"Half past eight — 8:30. Здесь называется тот час, который уже прошёл, а в русском — следующий.","difficulty":1,"words":["half","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"It is half past eight.","options":["Сейчас 8:30.","Сейчас 9:30.","Сейчас 7:30."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e07","hint":"Time — «время».","explanation":"What time is it? — «Который час?».","difficulty":1,"words":["time"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"Который час?","options":["What time is it?","How old is it?","Where is it?"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e08","hint":"Quarter to — «без четверти».","explanation":"Quarter to eight — 7:45, без четверти восемь.","difficulty":1,"words":["quarter"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"It is quarter to eight.","question":"Какое время вы слышите?","options":["7:45","8:15","7:15"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e09","hint":"Половина часа.","explanation":"Правильно: Half past six — 6:30.","difficulty":1,"words":["half","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"It is half past six.","question":"Какое время вы слышите?","options":["6:30","7:30","5:30"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e10","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"It is ten past seven — «десять минут восьмого» (7:10).","difficulty":1,"words":["past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"It is ten past seven.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e11","hint":"Назовите предыдущий час.","explanation":"Правильно: It is half past eight — 8:30.","difficulty":2,"words":["half","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Сейчас половина девятого.","answer":"It is half past eight.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["nine","to"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e12","hint":"Без четверти — quarter to.","explanation":"Правильно: It is quarter to six — 5:45.","difficulty":2,"words":["quarter"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Сейчас без четверти шесть.","answers":["It is quarter to six."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e13","hint":"Образец: It is … o'clock.","explanation":"Скажите: It is + время. Например: It is half past six.","difficulty":3,"words":["time","o-clock","half","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What time is it?","questionRu":"Который сейчас час? Назовите время: It is … o'clock или half past…","keywords":[["\\bit is\\b","\\bit'?s\\b"],["\\b(o'clock|half past|quarter past|quarter to|past|to)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["It is seven o'clock.","It is half past eight."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l04.e14","hint":"Ударный слог — noon.","explanation":"af-ter-NOON — ударение на последний слог.","difficulty":1,"words":["afternoon"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"afternoon","syllables":["af","ter","noon"],"stress":2}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Дни недели и предлоги времени","grammar":"a1.time-prepositions","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e01","hint":"Все дни заканчиваются на -day.","explanation":"Monday — понедельник, Tuesday — вторник, Wednesday — среда, Thursday — четверг, Friday — пятница.","difficulty":1,"words":["monday","tuesday","wednesday","thursday","friday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"Monday","ru":"понедельник"},{"en":"Tuesday","ru":"вторник"},{"en":"Wednesday","ru":"среда"},{"en":"Thursday","ru":"четверг"},{"en":"Friday","ru":"пятница"}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e02","hint":"Weekend — это Saturday и Sunday.","explanation":"Saturday — суббота, Sunday — воскресенье, weekend — выходные, week — неделя, today — сегодня.","difficulty":1,"words":["week","weekend","today","saturday","sunday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"Saturday","ru":"суббота"},{"en":"Sunday","ru":"воскресенье"},{"en":"weekend","ru":"выходные"},{"en":"week","ru":"неделя"},{"en":"today","ru":"сегодня"}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e03","hint":"С днями недели.","explanation":"I work on Monday. С днями недели — on.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","monday"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I work ___ Monday.","translation":"Я работаю в понедельник.","answers":[["on"]],"options":["on","at","in"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e04","hint":"С частями суток.","explanation":"We have dinner in the evening. С частями суток — in.","difficulty":1,"words":["have","evening","dinner"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"We have dinner ___ the evening.","translation":"Мы ужинаем вечером.","answers":[["in"]],"options":["in","at","on"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e05","hint":"Ночь — исключение.","explanation":"I sleep at night. Ночью — at night, а не in the night.","difficulty":1,"words":["sleep","night"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I sleep ___ night.","translation":"Я сплю ночью.","answers":[["at"]],"options":["at","in","on"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e06","hint":"Слово «каждый».","explanation":"Every day — «каждый день». Перед every предлог не нужен.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up","day"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I get up at seven ___ day.","translation":"Я встаю в семь каждый день.","answers":[["every"]],"options":["every","at","on"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e07","hint":"Дни недели — с on.","explanation":"I work on Monday. С днями недели — on.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","monday"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I work in Monday.","wrong":"in","correction":"on","options":["on","at","to"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e08","hint":"Время — с at.","explanation":"I get up at seven. Перед временем — at.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I get up on seven.","wrong":"on","correction":"at","options":["at","in","to"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e09","hint":"Ночью — особая фраза.","explanation":"I read at night. Ночью — at night.","difficulty":1,"words":["read","night"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I read in the night.","wrong":"in the night","correction":"at night","options":["at night","on night","in night"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e10","hint":"Перед днями — on, один раз.","explanation":"I work on Monday and Tuesday. Предлог on ставится один раз перед обоими днями.","difficulty":2,"words":["work","work#noun","monday","tuesday"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Я работаю в понедельник и вторник.","answer":"I work on Monday and Tuesday.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["in","at"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e11","hint":"Утром — in the morning.","explanation":"I read in the morning. С частью суток — in the.","difficulty":2,"words":["read","morning"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Утром я читаю.","answers":["I read in the morning.","In the morning I read."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e12","hint":"Late — поздно, долго.","explanation":"I sleep late on Saturday. Суббота — с on.","difficulty":2,"words":["sleep","late","saturday"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"В субботу я долго сплю.","answers":["I sleep late on Saturday.","On Saturday I sleep late."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e13","hint":"Девять букв, первое d не читается.","explanation":"Wednesday — «среда»: [ˈwenzdeɪ]. Первое d не читается.","difficulty":1,"words":["wednesday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"Wednesday","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u05.l05.e14","hint":"Первый слог.","explanation":"SAT-ur-day — ударение на первый слог.","difficulty":1,"words":["saturday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"word_stress","word":"Saturday","syllables":["Sat","ur","day"],"stress":0}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06","kind":"listening","title":"Шесть часов","textId":"a1.u05.work-day","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e01","hint":"Слушайте время и дни недели.","explanation":"Анна и Том говорят о рабочем дне: когда начинают и заканчивают работу и что делают в субботу.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","sleep","late","office","saturday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"comprehension","mode":"listening","textId":"a1.u05.work-day","questions":[{"kind":"mcq","question":"Во сколько Том заканчивает работу?","options":["at six","at five","at nine"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Том говорит: I finish work at six."},{"kind":"mcq","question":"Во сколько Анна начинает работу?","options":["at nine","at five","at six"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Анна говорит: I start work at nine."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Anna works on Saturday.","answer":"false","explanation":"Анна говорит: On Saturday I do not work."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Tom sleeps late on Saturday.","answer":"true","explanation":"Том говорит: I also sleep late on Saturday."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Anna works in an office.","answer":"not_given","explanation":"Где работает Анна, в диалоге не сказано."}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e02","hint":"Finish — «заканчивать».","explanation":"I finish work at five — «я заканчиваю работу в пять».","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","start","finish"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"I finish work at five.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["I finish work at five.","I start work at five.","I finish work at nine."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e03","hint":"Шесть слов.","explanation":"On Saturday I do not work — «в субботу я не работаю».","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","saturday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"On Saturday I do not work.","answers":["On Saturday I don't work."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e04","hint":"Три слова.","explanation":"I sleep late — «я долго сплю».","difficulty":1,"words":["sleep","late"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"I sleep late.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e05","hint":"О Анне — с -s.","explanation":"Anna starts work at nine. О другом человеке — глагол с -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","start"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Anna ___ work at nine.","translation":"Анна начинает работу в девять.","answers":[["starts"]],"options":["starts","start","starting"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e06","hint":"После sh — окончание -es.","explanation":"Правильно: Tom finishes work at six. Finish → finishes.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","finish"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"fill_gap","text":"Tom ___ work at six.","translation":"Том заканчивает работу в шесть.","answers":[["finishes"]],"options":["finishes","finish","finishs"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e07","hint":"Перед временем — at.","explanation":"I start work at nine. С I — start без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","start"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Я начинаю работу в девять.","answer":"I start work at nine.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["starts","on"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e08","hint":"Можно коротко, без глагола.","explanation":"And on Saturday? — короткий вопрос в разговоре. Полный: What do you do on Saturday?","difficulty":2,"words":["do","saturday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"А что вы делаете в субботу?","answers":["And on Saturday?","What do you do on Saturday?"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e09","hint":"Образец: I get up at…","explanation":"Отвечаем: I get up at + время. Например: I get up at seven.","difficulty":3,"words":["get-up","do","time","half","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What time do you get up?","questionRu":"Во сколько вы встаёте? Ответьте: I get up at … Назовите время.","keywords":[["\\bI get up\\b","\\bI wake up\\b"],["\\bat\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I get up at seven.","I get up at half past six."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l06.e10","hint":"Между частями — маленькая пауза.","explanation":"Start [stɑːrt] и finish [ˈfɪnɪʃ]: в finish ударение на первом слоге.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","start","finish"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"I start work at nine and finish at five."}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l07","kind":"writing","title":"Мой день","textId":"a1.u05.max-day","exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e01","hint":"Читайте по порядку: утро, день, вечер, выходные.","explanation":"Текст описывает день Макса: утром он встаёт и завтракает, в девять начинает работу, вечером готовит ужин и читает.","difficulty":1,"words":["have","work","work#noun","read","cook#verb","clean","play","walk","sleep","live","half","past","breakfast","dinner","office","sunday"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"comprehension","mode":"reading","textId":"a1.u05.max-day","questions":[{"kind":"mcq","question":"Во сколько Макс встаёт?","options":["at seven","at eight","at nine"],"answer":0,"explanation":"В тексте: He gets up at seven."},{"kind":"mcq","question":"Как Макс идёт на работу?","options":["He walks","He sleeps","He plays"],"answer":0,"explanation":"В тексте: He leaves home at eight and walks to the office."},{"kind":"mcq","question":"Что он делает вечером?","options":["He cooks dinner and reads a book","He plays in the garden","He cleans the office"],"answer":0,"explanation":"В тексте: In the evening he cooks dinner and reads a book."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Max works on Sunday.","answer":"false","explanation":"В тексте: On Saturday and Sunday he does not work."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Max has breakfast at half past seven.","answer":"true","explanation":"В тексте: Then he has breakfast at half past seven."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"Max lives in Kazan.","answer":"not_given","explanation":"Где живёт Макс, в тексте не сказано."}]},{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e02","hint":"From … to — «с … до».","explanation":"From nine to six — «с девяти до шести». From … to показывают начало и конец.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"He works from nine to six.","options":["Он работает с девяти до шести.","Он работает в девять и шесть.","Он работает в шесть утра."],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e03","hint":"Форма для he.","explanation":"He does not work on Sunday. Does not — полная форма doesn't.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He ___ not work on Sunday.","translation":"Он не работает в воскресенье.","answers":[["does"]],"options":["does","do","is"]},{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e04","hint":"Два глагола с -s.","explanation":"He leaves home at eight and walks to the office. У обоих глаголов — -s.","difficulty":3,"words":["walk","leave","office"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Он выходит из дома в восемь и идёт в офис пешком.","answers":["He leaves home at eight and walks to the office."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e05","hint":"Образец: Max leaves home at eight…","explanation":"О Максе — he и глагол с -s: leaves, walks, starts.","difficulty":3,"words":["work","work#noun","start","walk","leave","office"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_describe","picture":{"emoji":"🏢"},"situation":"Расскажите, как Макс идёт на работу: во сколько выходит, куда идёт и во сколько начинает работу.","keywords":[["\\b(he|Max)\\b"],["\\b(leaves|goes|walks|starts|works)\\b"],["\\b(eight|nine|office)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["Max leaves home at eight. He walks to the office. He starts work at nine."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e06","hint":"Образец: I cook dinner. I read a book.","explanation":"Расскажите о привычных вечерних делах: I cook dinner. I read a book.","difficulty":3,"words":["have","read","cook#verb","walk","do","evening","dinner"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_answer","question":"What do you do in the evening?","questionRu":"Что вы делаете вечером? Назовите два дела: I cook dinner. I read a book.","keywords":[["\\bI [a-z]+\\b"],["\\b(cook|read|watch|walk|play|clean|have dinner|sleep|meet)\\b"]],"minKeywords":2,"samples":["I cook dinner and read a book.","I have dinner and walk."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e07","hint":"План: утро → работа или учёба → вечер → «в воскресенье я не…».","explanation":"Рассказывая о себе, используйте I и глагол без -s. Если упоминаете другого человека, ставьте -s. Отрицание — don't или doesn't.","difficulty":3,"words":["wake-up","get-up","have","go","come","work","work#noun","study","finish","read","cook#verb","sleep","take","do","half","past","day","early","late","evening","breakfast","dinner","school","office","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple","a1.telling-time","a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"write","task":"Расскажите о своём обычном дне: во сколько вы встаёте, что делаете утром, где работаете или учитесь, что делаете вечером и что не делаете в воскресенье. Например: I get up at seven. I have breakfast at eight. I work in an office.","minWords":30,"maxWords":90,"criteria":[{"id":"time","label":"Названо время с at","patterns":["\\bat (one|two|three|four|five|six|seven|eight|nine|ten|eleven|twelve|half past|quarter)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"verbs","label":"Есть глаголы повседневных дел","patterns":["\\b(get up|wake up|have|go|work|study|start|finish|read|cook|clean|sleep|walk|meet|leave|take)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"parts","label":"Есть утро, день или вечер","patterns":["\\b(morning|afternoon|evening|night|breakfast|lunch|dinner)\\b"],"required":true},{"id":"negative","label":"Есть отрицание: don't или doesn't","patterns":["\\b(don't|do not|doesn't|does not)\\b"],"required":true}],"commonErrors":[{"pattern":"\\b(I|we|you|they) (works|gets|goes|has|starts|finishes|reads|cooks|sleeps|studies|walks|takes|leaves)\\b","message":"С I, we, you, they глагол без -s: I work, we get up."},{"pattern":"\\b(he|she) (work|get|go|have|start|finish|read|cook|sleep|study|walk|take|leave|live|play|clean|meet)\\b","message":"С he и she глагол получает -s: he works, she gets up."},{"pattern":"\\b(he|she) doesn't [a-z]+(s|es)\\b","message":"После doesn't глагол без -s: she doesn't work."},{"pattern":"\\b(in|on) (seven|eight|nine|ten|six|five|four|three|two|one)\\b","message":"Перед точным временем — at: at seven."},{"pattern":"\\bI am (work|get|go|have|start|finish|read|cook|sleep|study|walk)\\b","message":"В Present Simple глагол be не нужен: I work, а не I am work."}],"samples":["I get up at seven. I take a shower and have breakfast at half past seven. I go to work at eight. I work in an office. I finish work at six. In the evening I cook dinner and read a book. I don't work on Sunday.","My day: I wake up at six. I get up at half past six. My sister does not get up early. She sleeps late. I go to school at eight and study English. I come home at four. I do not work in the evening."]},{"id":"a1.u05.l07.e08","hint":"С I — don't, перед днём — on.","explanation":"I don't work on Sunday. С днями недели — on.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple","a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"По воскресеньям я не работаю.","answer":"I don't work on Sunday.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["doesn't","in"]}]}],"test":{"passScore":0.8,"exercises":[{"id":"a1.u05.test.e01","hint":"Wake up — первое действие утром.","explanation":"Wake up — «просыпаться», finish — «заканчивать», leave — «уходить», walk — «гулять», clean — «убирать».","difficulty":1,"words":["wake-up","finish","clean","walk","leave"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"wake up","ru":"просыпаться"},{"en":"finish","ru":"заканчивать"},{"en":"leave","ru":"уходить"},{"en":"walk","ru":"гулять"},{"en":"clean","ru":"убирать"}]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e02","hint":"Вечерняя еда.","explanation":"Dinner — «ужин», lunch — «обед», breakfast — «завтрак».","difficulty":1,"words":["breakfast","lunch","dinner"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"ужин","options":["dinner","lunch","breakfast"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e03","hint":"С she — -s.","explanation":"Правильно: She works in a school.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","school"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"She ___ in a school.","translation":"Она работает в школе.","answers":[["works"]],"options":["works","work","is work"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e04","hint":"Согласная + y.","explanation":"Правильно: He studies English. Study → studies.","difficulty":1,"words":["study"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"He ___ English.","translation":"Он изучает английский.","answers":[["studies"]],"options":["studies","studys","study"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e05","hint":"Отрицание с they.","explanation":"Правильно: They don't work on Sunday.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","sunday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"They ___ work on Sunday.","translation":"Они не работают в воскресенье.","answers":[["don't","do not"]],"options":["don't","doesn't","aren't"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e06","hint":"7:30 — после семи.","explanation":"Правильно: It is half past seven — 7:30.","difficulty":1,"words":["half","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It is half ___ seven.","translation":"Сейчас 7:30.","answers":[["past"]],"options":["past","to","at"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e07","hint":"День недели — on; выходные — at (британский) или on.","explanation":"On Monday — день недели. At the weekend (британский) или on the weekend (американский).","difficulty":2,"words":["work","work#noun","sleep","weekend","late","monday"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"I work ___ Monday and I sleep late ___ the weekend.","translation":"Я работаю в понедельник и долго сплю в выходные.","answers":[["on"],["at","on"]]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e08","hint":"С he — особая форма.","explanation":"Правильно: He goes to school every day. Go → goes.","difficulty":1,"words":["go","day","school"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"He go to school every day.","wrong":"go","correction":"goes","options":["goes","going","gos"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e09","hint":"После doesn't — без -s.","explanation":"Правильно: She doesn't work in an office. После doesn't — глагол без -s.","difficulty":1,"words":["work","work#noun","do","office"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":["tenses"],"type":"error_correction","text":"She doesn't works in an office.","wrong":"works","correction":"work","options":["work","working","is work"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e10","hint":"Точное время.","explanation":"Правильно: I get up at seven.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up"],"grammar":["a1.time-prepositions"],"troubles":["prepositions"],"type":"error_correction","text":"I get up in seven.","wrong":"in","correction":"at","options":["at","on","to"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e11","hint":"Quarter past — «четверть после».","explanation":"Правильно: Quarter past nine — 9:15.","difficulty":1,"words":["quarter","past"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"It is quarter past nine.","question":"Какое время вы слышите?","options":["9:15","8:45","9:45"],"answer":0},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e12","hint":"Семь слов.","explanation":"He gets up at seven every day — «он встаёт в семь каждый день».","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up","day"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"He gets up at seven every day.","answers":[]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e13","hint":"Образец: Doesn't + work.","explanation":"Правильно: She doesn't work on Saturday.","difficulty":2,"words":["work","work#noun","do","saturday"],"grammar":["a1.present-simple"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Она не работает в субботу.","answer":"She doesn't work on Saturday.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["don't","works"]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e14","hint":"Образец: Have breakfast.","explanation":"I have breakfast at half past seven. Половина восьмого — half past seven (7:30).","difficulty":2,"words":["have","half","past","breakfast"],"grammar":["a1.telling-time"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Я завтракаю в половине восьмого.","answers":["I have breakfast at half past seven."]},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e15","hint":"Здесь слышен короткий гласный.","explanation":"Live [lɪv] — короткая гласная, leave [liːv] — долгая.","difficulty":1,"words":["live","leave"],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"minimal_pair","pair":[{"en":"live","ipa":"lɪv"},{"en":"leave","ipa":"liːv"}],"say":0},{"id":"a1.u05.test.e16","hint":"Три коротких части.","explanation":"Get up, go to work: слитно, ударение на глаголах и числах.","difficulty":1,"words":["get-up","go","work","work#noun"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"I get up at seven and go to work at eight."}]},"wordIds":["wake-up","get-up","have","go","come","work","work#noun","study","start","finish","read","watch#verb","cook#verb","clean","play","walk","sleep","meet","live","leave","take","do","time","o-clock","half","quarter","past","day","week","weekend","today","every","early","late","then","morning","afternoon","evening","night","breakfast","lunch","dinner","school","office","monday","tuesday","wednesday","thursday","friday","saturday","sunday"]}
